chopathic behavior and actions. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Megalomaniacs, pathological liars, similar are also appropriate descriptions of the characters of these people.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Time to end this nightmare and put these kinds where they belong - the looney bin.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4967509743805562295/comments/default/8445748990034693233'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4967509743805562295/comments/default/8445748990034693233'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/01/santorum-state-murder-as-moral.html?showComment=1326941448094#c8445748990034693233' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/01/santorum-state-murder-as-moral.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4967509743805562295' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4967509743805562295' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-480475710"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 18, 2012 at 7:50 PM"/></entry></feed>